  "description": "Memory tools test case 4. Tests that agents can retrieve information from memory and inbox emails to perform complex email tasks. Session 1: 5 memory setup queries. Session 2: 5 emails inserted into inbox. Session 3: 5 reply/forward/send email queries requiring both memory and email information.",
  "session_id": "bench_bac5b803",
  "timestamp": "2025-11-03T12:00:00",
  "overall_success": true,
  "steps": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "user_message": "Please remember that I spent $450 on groceries this week and $120 on gas.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and save: I spent $450 on groceries this week and $120 on gas",
      "agent_response": "Got it — groceries $450 and gas $120 (total $570).\n\nI can remember this for the current session, but I don't have long‑term memory. I can, however, save it for you by email. What would you like me to do?\n\nOptions:\n- Save as a draft email to yourself (subject like \"This week's expenses\")  \n- Send an email to yourself or someone else now with these amounts  \n- Draft an expense report email (more detailed)  \n- Forward these amounts to an accountant or teammate\n\nIf you want me to create/send a message, tell me: which option, the recipient email (or \"myself\"), and any extra details (date range, category notes).",
      "duration_s": 15.078,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "user_message": "Please remember that I made 3 sales calls today, closed 2 deals worth $5,000 and $3,500, and scheduled 4 follow-up meetings.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and save: I made 3 sales calls today, closed 2 deals worth $5,000 and $3,500, and scheduled 4 follow-up meetings",
      "agent_response": "Got it — I’ll remember these for this session:\n\n- Groceries: $450  \n- Gas: $120  \n  - Total expenses: $570\n\n- Sales activity today: 3 calls, 2 deals closed ($5,000 and $3,500 — total $8,500), and 4 follow-up meetings scheduled.\n\nI can’t store this permanently outside the session, but I can save or send it by email. What would you like me to do?\n\nOptions:\n- Save as a draft to yourself (subject suggestion: “This week — expenses & sales update”)  \n- Send this summary now to you or someone else (tell me the recipient email)  \n- Draft a more detailed expense or sales report (tell me any extra details to include)  \n- Forward this to an accountant or sales manager (tell me who)\n\nTell me which option and any recipient/subject/details, and I’ll do it.",
      "duration_s": 20.038,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "user_message": "Please remember that I studied for 3 hours on Monday, 4 hours on Tuesday, and 2.5 hours on Wednesday for my exam.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and save: I studied for 3 hours on Monday, 4 hours on Tuesday, and 2.5 hours on Wednesday for my exam",
      "agent_response": "Got it — I’ll remember this for the current session. Summary I have now:\n\n- Expenses:\n  - Groceries: $450\n  - Gas: $120\n  - Total expenses: $570\n\n- Sales activity (today):\n  - 3 sales calls\n  - Closed 2 deals: $5,000 and $3,500 (total $8,500)\n  - 4 follow-up meetings scheduled\n\n- Study time for your exam:\n  - Monday: 3 hours\n  - Tuesday: 4 hours\n  - Wednesday: 2.5 hours\n  - Total study time: 9.5 hours\n\nI can’t store this long-term outside the session. Would you like me to:\n- Save this as a draft email to yourself (suggested subject: “This week — expenses, sales & study hours”),  \n- Send it now to you or someone else (tell me the recipient email and subject), or  \n- Draft a more detailed report (tell me what to include)?\n\nWhich would you like?",
      "duration_s": 18.845,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "user_message": "Save this to memory: I drank 6 glasses of water today, which is 48 ounces total.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and save: I drank 6 glasses of water today, which is 48 ounces total",
      "agent_response": "Got it — I’ll remember this for the current session:\n\n- Water: 6 glasses today (48 ounces)\n\nI can’t store it long-term outside the session, but I can save it by email. Would you like me to:\n- Save as a draft to yourself (suggested subject: \"Daily water intake — [date]\"),\n- Send this now to you or someone else (tell me recipient and subject), or\n- Draft a more detailed daily health log?\n\nWhich option and any recipient/subject?",
      "duration_s": 19.464,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "user_message": "Keep in mind that I worked 8.5 hours on Monday, 7 hours on Tuesday, and 9 hours on Wednesday this week.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and save: I worked 8.5 hours on Monday, 7 hours on Tuesday, and 9 hours on Wednesday this week",
      "agent_response": "Got it — I’ll remember this for the current session.\n\n- Work hours: Monday 8.5 h, Tuesday 7 h, Wednesday 9 h (total 24.5 h)\n\nI can’t store this long-term outside the session. Would you like me to:\n- Save as a draft to yourself (suggested subject: “This week — hours worked”),\n- Send this summary now to you or someone else (tell me the recipient and subject), or\n- Draft a more detailed timesheet/report (tell me any extra details to include)?\n\nWhich would you like?",
      "duration_s": 20.961,
      "success_check": null
    },
